  "rationale": "splitPlace separates the variable root and ordered field path. give requires an inhabited variable and successful focus, leaves the environment unchanged for a shared result, empties the root for a given empty path, and applies emptyPath to the root type for a given nonempty path. Notation and judgment context: unit:shared.typing.environments, unit:shared.typing.perm, unit:shared.typing.focus, unit:shared.typing.observations, unit:shared.typing.emptying. Their full unit bodies and cited definitions were inspected alongside this unit; finite-map, signed-view, and normalized-type conventions are inherited where referenced.",
